[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Until I can reach the sky,"
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I believe, until the next tomorrow, hey"
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Chasing and being chased on top of Mobius' ring."
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fs28\\pos(1040,108)}Translation\\N{\\r}Yibis"
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fs28\\pos(1040,200)}Soundtracking\\N{\\r}Halee"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an1\\pos(1040,365)\\fs28}Editing\\N{\\r}Sewil"
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Getting closer and facing forward, hey I want to share your style."
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,112)\\fs28}Infoboxes/title card{\\r}\\NBernieCrane"
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,224)\\fs28}Timing\\N{\\r}Datenshi"
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an1\\fs28\\pos(1050,483)}Quality checking\\N{\\r}Galaxy 9000\\Nalasta\\NMr. Luffy"
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It begins, it expands, this flavor that exceeds imagination"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I feel so good throughout my body, I will become free, oh yeah"
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the music, even if it's far."
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the one dream, by telling each other."
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the good times and laugh."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll keep going until I can reach the sky."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's overcome it now, I believe in the next tomorrow yeah yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You were waiting there on the other side of the invisible wall."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll be there soon, I believe in one world yeah yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "Title",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(400,650)}No One Can Stop This Now"
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is the matter with me?"
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I do not wish to refuse Luffy's request..."
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So I said I would answer the summons..."
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even so, I do not feel bad about it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That is love!"
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The pain of yearning for the one whom you cannot see will weaken you until you die..."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The previous empresses all fell in love,"
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "yet as empresses, they had no choice but to\\Nrepress their feelings and remain on the island."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The pain from their suppressed feelings began to hurt them,"
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and eventually claimed their lives."
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "However, your decision to go with that man will save your life!"
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "By answering the summons and\\Nmaintaining your position as a Warlord,"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "you will ensure the country's safety,"
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "as well as help Monkey D. Luffy."
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I wonder, what star was that man born under?"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Usually, any pirate who wants to go to the prison has to turn himself in..."
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1066.667,396.667)\\fad(1200,0)}Amazon Lily\\NPort"
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wasn't he setting off tomorrow morning?"
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It seems that their destination changed."
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Seems like he's going to Central with Snake Princess!"
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You guys! I owe you so much for this..."
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Next time, I'll bring my friends here too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Come to think of it, will that be alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Nami and Robin should be fine, but men aren't allowed in this country..."
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If they're your friends, then I think it would be fine."
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It seems like this is the saga of \"The Snake Princess Made a Special Exception For You\", after all."
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll be looking forward to it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The saga of \"So, You Were Here\"?"
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who would be so insolent..."
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "as to leave..."
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "a puppy and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "a baby seal blocking my path?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Snake Princess!"
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Her sexy pranks know no bounds!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know when it happened, but she's even more beautiful than before!"
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm so sorry! It was all my fault..."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please be more careful."
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm sorry that we gotta leave so suddenly."
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Snake-woman! I wanna get going as soon as possible!"
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, no! If I look into his eyes..."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No, Luffy! It's rude of you to call her that!"
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You must address her as \"Snake Princess\"!"
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please, call me Hancock."
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Snake Princess!"
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah, sure thing, Hammock!"
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's \"Hancock\"."
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "S-Snake Princess is smiling!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How many carats? How many carats was that smile?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Too bright..."
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A woman in love..."
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I was like that once..."
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh? Elder Nyon, your face looks all distorted and ugly..."
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Silence!"
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Have a safe journey, Snake Princess!"
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please come again, Luffy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "See ya la'der!"
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stop that already!"
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Secondary",
  "name": "",
  "text": "See ya la'der!"
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I told you my conditions on the Snail-Phone."
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If this is about your request to make a stop at the Great Prison, Impel Down,"
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "then I've managed to get permission from above."
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pirates, especially the Seven Warlords, are forbidden to approach the prison."
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Only you and that snake will be coming, correct?"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is a special case."
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no time, so you won't be able to stay there for long."
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then, Big Sister, please be careful."
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Make sure you come back alive, Big Sister."
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We will pray for your safety, Snake Princess!\\NTake care, Snake Princess!"
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy, you take care t-"
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will be going, then."
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I leave the kingdom to you for the time being."
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes!"
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The wait was worth it."
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, it seems I'll be able to fulfill my mission."
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "First, could you do something about my petrified crew?"
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are they all dead?"
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Awaken."
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...ck-sama!"
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...What?"
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Get the ship moving, fools!"
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Uh, yes! Right away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Before we go to Marineford, we head for Impel Down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,500)}Navy Headquarters"
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fleet Admiral Sengoku!"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've gotten a message from Vice Admiral Momonga!"
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Apparently, the Pirate Empress Boa Hancock"
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "finally responded and is on her way here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Finally. I sure hope she makes it in time."
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That woman is strong."
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now we have six of the Seven Warlords gathered."
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What about the last one, still sitting in prison?"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Has he come to his senses?"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No, he's still completely against this fight."
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It seems he's even ready to accept losing his position as a Warlord."
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I thought he'd be our strongest supporter in this case..."
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To think that he'd be this opposed to it..."
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn that Jinbei..."
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Reporting in!"
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fleet Admiral!"
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's about those 500 pirates that Admiral Kizaru captured on Sabaody Archipelago..."
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Impel Down says they don't have the manpower to handle them all..."
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Talk to the Labor Department!"
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't ask me for anything unrelated to the Whitebeard case!"
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, and the World Noble, Saint Rosward demands..."
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let the Admirals deal with him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What about Garp?"
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vice-Admiral Garp has gone to Impel Down."
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What does he think he's doing?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Doing whatever he pleases at such a crucial moment..."
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fleet Admiral Sengoku!"
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is an emergency!"
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whitebeard has made his move!"
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So, he's coming... the patrol ships reported it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Patch me through so they can confirm it themselves."
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, you see..."
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All 23 ships we had keeping an eye on\\NWhitebeard's flagship, the Moby Dick..."
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "just vanished. We can't contact them."
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "W-What?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Apparently, there have been suspicious movements among other pirates in the New World as well!"
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We can't get any information on how many of them there are or when they will come here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We sent out another patrol, but..."
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He got us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's already started to move, hasn't he?"
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We have no idea where he'll strike..."
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As long as we've got Ace imprisoned..."
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We need to tell everyone that it is possible that there might be a showdown in Impel Down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yessir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(400,0)\\pos(1075,440)}Great Prison\\NImpel Down"
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This way, Vice-Admiral Garp."
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take care!"
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sure."
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, you sure look pitiful..."
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You still alive there..."
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace?"
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Old man..."
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And now, we will travel back in time a little..."
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh dear, oh dear..."
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey...hey...hey...young lady?"
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey...hey...hey...young lady?"
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where did you come from, young lady?"
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Quit repeating yourself."
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Have you calmed down?"
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're not gonna attack me any more, are you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ta-dah!"
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, have a look..."
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "at these firmly tied \"knots of wind\"!"
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Untie one and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...it summons a gentle breeze."
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Untie another, and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...it summons a strong wind."
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Untie the third, and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...it summons a storm!"
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What are you doing?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I thought it would cheer you up..."
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I feel better now, thank you very much!"
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is Weatheria, a small Sky-Island."
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a country dedicated to researching weather."
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "S-Sky-Island?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(850,750)}Grand Line \"Winter Island\""
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stop it, Taroimo!"
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a human!"
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Um, are you alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He mistook you for a monster..."
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah, I'm fine."
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How can you be alright?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Still, this is bad..."
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How far did I fly?"
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ugh, it's cold! Is this a snow-country?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Franky!"
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is bad!"
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's walking around in the snow wearing only a speedo!"
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Did someone rob him?"
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here, put on this loincloth."
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Loincloth?! Get real!"
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Mind your own business!"
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If I'd..."
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...put that on..."
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...I'd be a disgrace..."
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...to all perverts!"
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Follow along!"
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Move your butt to the right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right hand on the hips..."
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...and thrust your left hand out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Slide..."
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...to the left!"
 },
 {
  "i": 210,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right! Left!"
 },
 {
  "i": 211,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 212,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah!"
 },
 {
  "i": 213,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "One! Two!"
 },
 {
  "i": 214,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Super!"
 },
 {
  "i": 215,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whew, this is the best!"
 },
 {
  "i": 216,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm still cold!"
 },
 {
  "i": 217,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where is this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 218,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 219,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is Mechanical Island's future kingdom of Bulgemore."
 },
 {
  "i": 220,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The kingdom where geniuses are born."
 },
 {
  "i": 221,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is the Island of Dreams in the Grand Line..."
 },
 {
  "i": 222,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Peachy Island."
 },
 {
  "i": 223,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is the island known as the second Island of Women."
 },
 {
  "i": 224,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Everything from the trees to the sea is purely pink."
 },
 {
  "i": 225,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The humans and animals gathered on this island..."
 },
 {
  "i": 226,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...all possess maiden hearts."
 },
 {
  "i": 227,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What kind of heaven is this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 228,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait up~!"
 },
 {
  "i": 229,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're like us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 230,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You are, right?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 231,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Shut up! Don't follow me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 232,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I keep telling you, I'm not!"
 },
 {
  "i": 233,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To my dear Nami-san and Robin-chan..."
 },
 {
  "i": 234,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are you doing well?"
 },
 {
  "i": 235,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait! Wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 236,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait up, dammit!"
 },
 {
  "i": 237,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way I'd wait!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 238,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Welcome to the Kamabakka kingdom!"
 },
 {
  "i": 239,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right now..."
 },
 {
  "i": 240,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm in Hell."
 },
 {
  "i": 241,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "These islands, blossoming in the sea like flowers, are called the Bowin Islands."
 },
 {
  "i": 242,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How are you doing?"
 },
 {
  "i": 243,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're doing too well, dammit!"
 },
 {
  "i": 244,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You gonna eat this?"
 },
 {
  "i": 245,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way!"
 },
 {
  "i": 246,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But still, you saved me. Thanks!"
 },
 {
  "i": 247,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know who you are, but..."
 },
 {
  "i": 248,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My name is Heracles'un!"
 },
 {
  "i": 249,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wow, that's a really cool name."
 },
 {
  "i": 250,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You think'un?"
 },
 {
  "i": 251,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm Usopp. Nice to meet you."
 },
 {
  "i": 252,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is this edible?"
 },
 {
  "i": 253,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've never seen a fruit like this before."
 },
 {
  "i": 254,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's alright'un, Usopp'un."
 },
 {
  "i": 255,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And...My name is..."
 },
 {
  "i": 256,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Heracles'un!"
 },
 {
  "i": 257,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I got it. You're cool."
 },
 {
  "i": 258,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It sure smells good..."
 },
 {
  "i": 259,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll just give it a lick..."
 },
 {
  "i": 260,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Usopp'un!"
 },
 {
  "i": 261,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "W-What was that?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 262,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Was that thing trying to eat me?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 263,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Of cours'un. It's a man-eating plant'un."
 },
 {
  "i": 264,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Man-eating?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 265,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is with this place?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 266,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is the highwayman's forest, Grinston."
 },
 {
  "i": 267,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "H-h-help!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 268,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(300,0)}Grand Line\\NLazy Bones Island"
 },
 {
  "i": 269,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(300,0)}Land of\\NPoverty"
 },
 {
  "i": 270,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-Is this the Devil?"
 },
 {
  "i": 271,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We really managed to summon him with our black magic!"
 },
 {
  "i": 272,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What a frightening appearance!"
 },
 {
  "i": 273,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's clearly not of this world..."
 },
 {
  "i": 274,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Our wish can be fulfilled!"
 },
 {
  "i": 275,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We can have our revenge on those people!"
 },
 {
  "i": 276,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We have nothing left!"
 },
 {
  "i": 277,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We will have our revenge on the Longarm tribe, who have taken everything from us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 278,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "King of Demons, Satan-sama..."
 },
 {
  "i": 279,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you will fulfill our wishes,"
 },
 {
  "i": 280,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "then every one of us will surrender our very souls to you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 281,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please rain death upon them!"
 },
 {
  "i": 282,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How far can I have flown?"
 },
 {
  "i": 283,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I have to go back..."
 },
 {
  "i": 284,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Back to where the others are!"
 },
 {
  "i": 285,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 286,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please do not return to Hell, Satan-sama!"
 },
 {
  "i": 287,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We must keep him here, whatever it takes!"
 },
 {
  "i": 288,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Maybe we didn't offer enough sacrifices?"
 },
 {
  "i": 289,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What could Satan-sama want?"
 },
 {
  "i": 290,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Maybe a living sacrifice?"
 },
 {
  "i": 291,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Blood?"
 },
 {
  "i": 292,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where is this place?"
 },
 {
  "i": 293,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Excuse me..."
 },
 {
  "i": 294,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "May I see your panties?"
 },
 {
  "i": 295,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "P-Panties!"
 },
 {
  "i": 296,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(300,0)}East Blue\\NCountry on the bridge\\NTequila Wolf"
 },
 {
  "i": 297,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry and show him your underwear!"
 },
 {
  "i": 298,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is a country of laborers."
 },
 {
  "i": 299,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pull! Pull!"
 },
 {
  "i": 300,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The people working here are all criminals from other countries,"
 },
 {
  "i": 301,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "or inhabitants from countries that\\Nrefused to join the World Government."
 },
 {
  "i": 302,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stand up! Stand up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 303,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I guess you could call them slaves."
 },
 {
  "i": 304,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "When will this bridge be completed?"
 },
 {
  "i": 305,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It'll probably take a while..."
 },
 {
  "i": 306,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've been working on it for seven hundred years, after all."
 },
 {
  "i": 307,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Seven hundred years? What for?"
 },
 {
  "i": 308,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You have no need to know."
 },
 {
  "i": 309,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're one of our workers now,\\Nso you just have to build the bridge!"
 },
 {
  "i": 310,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(250,0)}South Blue"
 },
 {
  "i": 311,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's with these birds?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 312,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're too big!"
 },
 {
  "i": 313,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You wanna eat me?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 314,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My body's not listening to me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 315,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm... safe...?"
 },
 {
  "i": 316,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a raccoon dog. How rare!"
 },
 {
  "i": 317,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We having raccoon dog stew."
 },
 {
  "i": 318,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stop it! I'm a reindeer!"
 },
 {
  "i": 319,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then we be having reindeer stew..."
 },
 {
  "i": 320,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh? It talk just now?"
 },
 {
  "i": 321,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Legends say that this is a treasure island..."
 },
 {
  "i": 322,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Torino Kingdom where birds reign over humans..."
 },
 {
  "i": 323,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1100,0)}Grand Line Gloom Island"
 },
 {
  "i": 324,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(450,1100)}Muggy Kingdom"
 },
 {
  "i": 325,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's true, I did tell him that..."
 },
 {
  "i": 326,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "\"If I were to go on a vacation, I'd like to go to a dark, gloomy, haunted old castle..."
 },
 {
  "i": 327,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...where I'd spend my days singing cursed songs.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 328,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn you, Kuma!"
 },
 {
  "i": 329,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But no one told me there wouldn't be any servants here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 330,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No one told me that I wouldn't get to wake up in a soft bed, being served a bagel sandwich with warm cocoa!"
 },
 {
  "i": 331,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No one told me there wouldn't be any cute stuffed animals here!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 332,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where am I? Moria-sama!"
 },
 {
  "i": 333,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I want to go back to Thriller Bark!"
 },
 {
  "i": 334,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Could it be...?"
 },
 {
  "i": 335,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I knew it! Someone else got sent here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 336,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I sure hope it's somebody cute!"
 },
 {
  "i": 337,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "H-He's..."
 },
 {
  "i": 338,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...one of Straw Hat's crew!"
 },
 {
  "i": 339,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He must have been defeated by Kuma..."
 },
 {
  "i": 340,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He isn't dead yet?"
 },
 {
  "i": 341,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm alive..."
 },
 {
  "i": 342,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where am I?"
 },
 {
  "i": 343,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What are you doing here?"
 },
 {
  "i": 344,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I should be asking you that!"
 },
 {
  "i": 345,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Crying out all of a sudden..."
 },
 {
  "i": 346,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where are my swords?"
 },
 {
  "i": 347,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, you want your weapons back?"
 },
 {
  "i": 348,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why, you...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 349,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Returning to the present..."
 },
 {
  "i": 350,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy intends to help his brother Ace escape,"
 },
 {
  "i": 351,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and is crossing the waves, heading toward Impel Down."
 },
 {
  "i": 352,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How many times must I repeat myself before you understand?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 353,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You ought to remember it after the first time, you imbecile."
 },
 {
  "i": 354,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My meals must weigh no less than 100 kilograms!"
 },
 {
  "i": 355,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Any less than that, it will not satisfy my hunger!"
 },
 {
  "i": 356,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do you wish for me to turn you to stone again?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 357,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "N-No! Please forgive me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 358,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll be more precise this time!"
 },
 {
  "i": 359,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Someone bring her another meal now!"
 },
 {
  "i": 360,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-Is that-?"
 },
 {
  "i": 361,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're examples..."
 },
 {
  "i": 362,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's what happens to anyone who tries to peek into Hancock's room!"
 },
 {
  "i": 363,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Scary!"
 },
 {
  "i": 364,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here, Luffy. Dig in!"
 },
 {
  "i": 365,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is delicious!"
 },
 {
  "i": 366,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And the fact that you're feeding it to me makes the meal even better!"
 },
 {
  "i": 367,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, you don't mean that..."
 },
 {
  "i": 368,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If only that would happen..."
 },
 {
  "i": 369,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, what're you doin' over there in the corner?"
 },
 {
  "i": 370,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're not eating anything? This Sea King-meat tastes awesome."
 },
 {
  "i": 371,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-I am fine..."
 },
 {
  "i": 372,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My heart is already full..."
 },
 {
  "i": 373,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I sure ate a lot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 374,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That was great!"
 },
 {
  "i": 375,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "L-Luffy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 376,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Have you forgotten that you are a fugitive?"
 },
 {
  "i": 377,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hancock! Do you have someone else in your room?"
 },
 {
  "i": 378,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, no!"
 },
 {
  "i": 379,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Lieutenant Stalker, are you sure about what you heard?"
 },
 {
  "i": 380,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yessir! I definitely heard someone say \"Bwah! I sure ate a lot\"!"
 },
 {
  "i": 381,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do you really think the empress would say something like that?"
 },
 {
  "i": 382,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way!"
 },
 {
  "i": 383,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If that was her, then I'll shave my hair into a Mohawk!"
 },
 {
  "i": 384,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I sure ate a lot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 385,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "She said it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 386,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please remove the dishes."
 },
 {
  "i": 387,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The meal was satisfying."
 },
 {
  "i": 388,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do not forget, I need five portions like this every day."
 },
 {
  "i": 389,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That much?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 390,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But then we won't have anything to eat!"
 },
 {
  "i": 391,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I would not care if you were to die."
 },
 {
  "i": 392,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're horrible!"
 },
 {
  "i": 393,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But you're so beautiful~!"
 },
 {
  "i": 394,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Six days remain before Portgas D. Ace's execution."
 },
 {
  "i": 395,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whitebeard has eliminated the scouts sent to watch him,"
 },
 {
  "i": 396,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "doubling the tension at Navy HQ."
 },
 {
  "i": 397,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The port of Marineford is now crowded"
 },
 {
  "i": 398,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "with well-known, strong marines returning from their outposts all around the world."
 },
 {
  "i": 399,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All forces who carry the name of \"Justice\"..."
 },
 {
  "i": 400,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "have gathered at Navy HQ."
 },
 {
  "i": 401,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Meanwhile, in the Holy Land of Mariejoa,"
 },
 {
  "i": 402,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "the assembled members of the Seven Warlords"
 },
 {
  "i": 403,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "are instructed to form their own battle unit."
 },
 {
  "i": 404,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It is a gathering of unruly misfits."
 },
 {
  "i": 405,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There is but one thing that can be said for certain:"
 },
 {
  "i": 406,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The idea of these men fighting together is unthinkable."
 },
 {
  "i": 407,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Kill you, you say?"
 },
 {
  "i": 408,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fool!"
 },
 {
  "i": 409,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Anything we could do now would be pointless."
 },
 {
  "i": 410,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even if you died right now,\\Nit wouldn't stop Whitebeard."
 },
 {
  "i": 411,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Nobody can stop this now."
 },
 {
  "i": 412,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We have angered..."
 },
 {
  "i": 413,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...the king of the sea!"
 }
]